> Linux, I naturally
> asked if they were planning a port of the Digital Unix JDK to 
> Linux.  I was
> told that I "could probably expect that to occur eventually, 
> but other items
> are higher on the agenda."  (Or something similar.)
> 
> So... it's now been a few months.  Sure would be nice...  :)
> 

Unfortunately, the FastVM is only available for Tru64 and AFAIK, VMS/Alpha
is next on the list for upgrade to the FastVM.  I think when the Linux/Alpha
one comes out it will have the FastVM as well but this is hearsay.

