> scsi.c:799: (Each undeclared identifier is reported only once
> scsi.c:799: for each function it appears in.)
That's unusual.. make sure TYPE_ENCLOSURE is defined in 
include/scsi/scsi.h:
136:#define TYPE_ENCLOSURE      0x0d 

