a "sho | more" at the SRM console and it will sho you all of the variables.=
  Some have also said if you use modules that specifying the media type =
there works.

2) Check your network driver there have been discussions concerning the =
need for specific or newest drivers depending on platform and kernels.

3) There have been problems with some of the Multia's in the past.  Some =
folks have reported that the 10Base2 (Coax, BNC) port does not work but =
the other two do.  Others have reported problems with the 10BaseT (RJ45, =
twisted pair) but fine on the other two.

